    "note": "Aligned on 2026-10-05 (archival) with the method actually executed in the reported P8 v6 run of 2026-09-25 (docs/04_ai_methodology/P8_REAL_RUN_20260925.md). The prompt text in src/ai_rag/ollama_runner.py is the v6 text; the v2 label is kept here for history only. The v6 run itself was locked against its own run-specific run_config.json (private runtime)."
  }
